<title>AUSTRALIA: New Cap maiden half net profit A$342,000.</title>
<headline>New Cap maiden half net profit A$342,000.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  4.17 vs nil</p>
<p>    Net profit			  0.34 vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				45.13 vs nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: New Cap Reinsurance Corp Holdings Ltd is a reinsurance group, which was formed last year. New Cap said gross premium written income was A$177.99 million, while gross claims expense was A$30.24 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
